    <string name="rules_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="rules_1">Four planes per fleet. Be the first to bring all four to the centre.</string>
    <string name="rules_2">Roll a six to launch a plane, and roll again after any six.</string>
    <string name="rules_3">Land on your own colour and jump four spaces ahead.</string>
    <string name="rules_4">Land on the ringed space of your colour and fly straight across the opposite arm, then jump four more. A plane parked on the crossed lane is sent home.</string>
    <string name="rules_5">Landing on other fleets sends them back to their hangar. Your own planes may share a space.</string>
    <string name="rules_6">The centre needs an exact roll; any extra steps walk back.</string>
    <string name="rules_7">Humans and AI play by the same rules and the same fair die.</string>

